Robustness and Efficiency of Human-in-the-Loop (HIL) Feedback and Learning:
Can it be true? Yes, and critical. Abstractsunderscore the importance of HIL, preference optimization, and RLHF for aligning AI with human intent and continuous improvement. The explicit mention of RLHF and active learning in the idea's solution for user adoption challenges shows a strong understanding of this. The efficiency will depend on the UI/UX design, but the underlying AI mechanisms exist and are being refined.
